status (updated 2026-07-29):
  - RTL 8/8 PASS on chipyard 1.13.0 / RV32RocketConfig / verilator.
    The 8 cases (ci/run_regress.sh TESTS, ordered by RTL runtime):
      CLINT_sw_interrupt  EXCEPTION_traps  PMP_violation     CA_measure
      BENCH_dhrystone     BENCH_coremark   FREERTOS_preempt  UART_printf
  - CLINT_sw_interrupt: the chipyard co-sim latent defect noted in v304 is FIXED.
    Two changes were needed:
      1. verif_host.h now runs a DUT boot barrier (wait_dut_ready) before any host
         sequence, so bp_init()'s BP_TEST_init no longer clobbers the Vseq's opening
         host_set_bp(BP_TEST_begin).
      2. the Vseq releases dut_wait_bp(BP_TEST_success) at the end of every round,
         so the final round is not left spinning.
  - Known non-passing case: CLINT_timer_interrupt does not complete on RTL
    (3600s timeout). See verif/ip/S5740/S5740.list for the root-cause note.
    Do NOT add it to ci/run_regress.sh TESTS - run_rtl() has no timeout, so the
    regression would hang forever.
